        "created_at": "2013-04-21T03:13:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You distribute them evenly among the 3 Sectors. You cannot look at the Oposition cards first and decide which will go where, but you can decide beforehand which Sector will have more cards (if they don't divide evenly by 3).</p>",
